# GrimCodex Ruffle — .gitignore

## Unified build & distribution output
/dist/
/release-artifacts/

## Rust engine build artifacts & temp
/engine/target/
/engine/pgo-extracted/
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk

## .NET / Visual Studio (grim/)
grim/[Bb]in/
grim/[Oo]bj/
grim/packages/*
!grim/packages/repositories.config
grim/FodyWeavers.xsd
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.pdb

## Flash / Ruffle dev & temp files
*.swd
RECOVER_*.fla
.flash_players.toml

## Upstream Ruffle SWF test fixtures (~165 MB, 23k files; not needed to build desktop engine)
/engine/ruffle/tests/tests/swfs/

## Node.js (signaling server)
grim/signaling-server/node_modules/
grim/signaling-server/npm-debug.log*

## Scratch, logs & backups
scratch/
*.tmp
*.log
*.bak
*.backup

## Editors & OS junk
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

